    "Send a shielded payment",
    "Plan/commit shielded spend: without confirm, a non-mutating plan "
    "bound to wallet_scope, from, to, exact amount, memo, and idempotency "
    "key; with confirm:true, the synchronous z_sendmany transaction id "
    "(stage=committed). memo attaches a UTF-8 Sapling memo to a "
    "shielded recipient (memo_hex for raw bytes; memo_hex wins if both "
    "are given) and is echoed back as memo_attached — this is how a "
    "payment carries an application binding such as a store order id. "
    "idempotency_key correlates plan to commit; it "
